  "contentHtml": "<P>자율활동시간에 학생수 혹은 적당한 수만큼 명화를 잘라 나누어 준 후 퍼즐 맞추듯 맞추고 뒷면을 붙여 게시판에 붙여 전시합니다. 아래쪽에 조그마하게 자기 싸인도 넣고,,, 협동심 까지는 아니지만 함께 한다는 마음으로 해보는 활동들.. </P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23293D47542398471E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"333\" height=\"213\" style=\"WIDTH: 333px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 213px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"PHOTO_0540.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_23293D47542398471EF14B\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/243A47475423984804\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"285\" height=\"213\" style=\"WIDTH: 285px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 213px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"PHOTO_0541.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_243A474754239848044B75\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/27367447542398490A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"337\" height=\"221\" style=\"WIDTH: 337px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 221px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"PHOTO_0543.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_27367447542398490AA0FB\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/213747475423984A09\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"301\" height=\"228\" style=\"WIDTH: 301px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 228px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"PHOTO_0545.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_213747475423984A09C052\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22228F475423984B28\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"645\" height=\"424\" style=\"WIDTH: 645px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 424px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"PHOTO_0548.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_22228